  "instance_name": "abusive_meme_intention",
  "label": "Abusive Meme Intention",
  "description": "The meme is designed to be abusive, using vulgar language and a demeaning metaphor to attack an individual. The intent is to insult and provoke a negative emotional response. This type of meme relies on the understanding that the content is meant to be offensive and degrading, which is a common characteristic of abusive online content. The background knowledge required to understand this includes the concept of abusive intent in digital communication and the cultural context of internet memes.",
